<title>FRANCE: Colas U.S. unit wins road-resurfacing pact.</title>
<headline>Colas U.S. unit wins road-resurfacing pact.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>French roadbuilder and civil engineering group Colas said that its U.S. unit Barrett Paving Materials Inc had won a contract worth $12.47 million to resurface 10.5 km of a highway in New York state.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
